@OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5151

### Categories — hierarchical tree
GET {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Products — paginated list
GET {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Products — filter by category (includes subcategories)
GET {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?categoryId=2&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Product by id
GET {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create product
POST {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "Created via HTTP file for Step 2 verification.",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stockQuantity": 5,
  "categoryId": 4,
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/seed/testproduct/600/600"
}

### Update product
PUT {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Classic Cotton T-Shirt Updated",
  "description": "Soft everyday tee in a regular fit.",
  "price": 27.99,
  "stockQuantity": 110,
  "categoryId": 4,
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/seed/tee/600/600"
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{OnlineShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/12
Accept: application/json
